==Strategy==
This stage consists of buffed peons and a Ururun Wolf with a 300% HP and 500% AP buff. Use meatshields with abilities against Alien, Black or traitless (i.e. [[Jetpack Cat (Rare Cat)|Jetpack Cat]], [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], [[Brainwashed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Eraser Cat]]).
You can also use [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] to clear the Dark Otters and Doge Darks, as well as [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer  Cat]] to [[Freeze]] alien peons and let Pizza Cat deal damage. And don't forget to bring a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] for the Ribbos, or just use the Breakerblast as there is only two of them.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*Ubers from the [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] gacha help a lot, since they all deal high damage to Traitless enemies, like [[Shadow Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Diabolic Gao]], [[King of Doom Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Extinction Phono]], and [[Izanami of Dusk (Legend Rare Cat)|Izanami of Eventide]].

